From 688ba43b6fc8d6654ebbbea93aeb62d192f7d673 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:21:09 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dock_fx: Adds Window Maker's dragged icon, ghost, slide,
 kaboom and balloons.

Visual effects for the Dock and the Clip, drawn on a scene tree above the
desktop, as Window Maker draws them:

* The icon dragged along with the pointer, and the "ghost" of the slot it
  will be attached to: The icon whitened with white at alpha 200, as
  MakeGhostIcon().
* The icon sliding into its slot, as slide_windows() with the "fast"
  IconSlideSpeed.
* The "kaboom" of an icon dropped off the docks, as DoKaboom(): Half of
  the 4x4 pieces, at random, fly off and fall out of the output, one step
  every 20 ms.
* Balloons: Text in a rounded box with a pointer to what it is for, shown
  after Window Maker's balloon delay of 1 s, or right away when the pointer
  comes straight from another balloon. Placed as Window Maker's showText().
  The colors come from the theme's optional 'Balloon' dict (Color,
  TextColor, BorderColor), defaulting to Window Maker's black on white.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
